        "node_id": "n_19_98e156",
        "thought_text": "Use dynamic programming with two state variables: 'total_sum' (sum of all current node labels) and 'count' (number of active paths). For each character in the input string, update these variables based on the transitions: L adds 2*label, R adds 2*label+1, P keeps label. If the character is '*', sum the results of all three possibilities. This linear scan is O(N) and handles N=10000 easily.",
